軍，太子左積弩將軍，射聲校尉。泰始初，遷輔國將軍、清河廣川二郡太守，幽州刺史。青州刺史沈文秀反，玄邈欲向朝廷，慮見掩襲，乃詣文秀求安軍頓。文秀令頓城外。玄邈卽立營壘，至夜拔軍南奔赴義。比曉，文秀追不復及。明帝以為持節、都督青州、青州刺史，將軍如故。","person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-027-wangxuanmiao:p001:m0060"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"所見原官稱，未載全任期。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-027-wangxuanmiao:p001","text":"玄載弟玄邈，字彥遠。初為驃騎行軍參軍，太子左積弩將軍，射聲校尉。泰始初，遷輔國將軍、清河廣川二郡太守，幽州刺史。青州刺史沈文秀反，玄邈欲向朝廷，慮見掩襲，乃詣文秀求安軍頓。文秀令頓城外。玄邈卽立營壘，至夜拔軍南奔赴義。比曉，文秀追不復及。明帝以為持節、都督青州、青州刺史，將軍如故。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":92,"last_line":92,"raw_start":6055,"raw_end":6196,"raw_character_offsets":[6055,6056,6057,6058,6059,6060,6061,6062,6063,6064,6065,6066,6067,6068,6069,6070,6071,6072,6073,6074,6075,6076,6077,6078,6079,6080,6081,6082,6083,6084,6085,6086,6087,6088,6089,6090,6091,6092,6093,6094,6095,6096,6097,6098,6099,6100,6101,6102,6103,6104,6105,6106,6107,6108,6109,6110,6111,6112,6113,6114,6115,6116,6117,6118,6119,6120,6121,6122,6123,6124,6125,6126,6127,6128,6129,6130,6131,6132,6133,6134,6135,6136,6137,6138,6139,6140,6141,6142,6143,6144,6145,6146,6147,6148,6149,6150,6151,6152,6153,6154,6155,6156,6157,6158,6159,6160,6161,6162,6163,6164,6165,6166,6167,6168,6169,6170,6171,6172,6173,6174,6175,6176,6177,6178,6179,6180,6181,6182,6183,6184,6185,6186,6187,6188,6189,6190,6191,6192,6193,6194,6195],"revision_id":1508012},"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-027-wangxuanmiao:p001:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"玄載","kind":"person","person_id":"85g_yq3_0w6_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-027-wangxuanmiao:p001:m0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"玄邈","kind":"person","person_id":"hgq_k4y_crp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-027-wangxuanmiao:p001:m0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"彥遠","kind":"person","person_id":"hgq_k4y_crp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-027-wangxuanmiao:p001:m0060","start":60,"end":63,"surface":"沈文秀","kind":"person","person_id":"jyf_yg2_dqk_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-027-wangxuanmiao:p001:m0065","start":65,"end":67,"surface":"玄邈","kind":"person","person_id":"hgq_k4y_crp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-027-wangxuanmiao:p001:m0079","start":79,"end":81,"surface":"文秀","kind":"person","person_id":"jyf_yg2_dqk_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-027-wangxuanmiao:p001:m0086","start":86,"end":88,"surface":"文秀","kind":"person","person_id":"jyf_yg2_dqk_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-027-wangxuanmiao:p001:m0093","start":93,"end":95,"surface":"玄邈","kind":"person","person_id":"hgq_k4y_crp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-027-wangxuanmiao:p001:m0112","start":112,"end":114,"surface":"文秀","kind":"person","person_id":"jyf_yg2_dqk_A","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-027-wangxuanmiao","book_id":"b-nanqishu-027","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-027-wangxuanmiao-ws1508012"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-shenwenxiu:p001","text":"沈文秀字仲遠，吳興武康人，司空慶之弟子也。父劭之，南中郎行參軍。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-songshu-088-shenwenxiu:p001:m0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"沈文秀","kind":"person","person_id":"jyf_yg2_dqk_A","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"傳首全名。"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-shenwenxiu:p001:m0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"仲遠","kind":"person","person_id":"jyf_yg2_dqk_A","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"文秀之字。"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-shenwenxiu:p001:m0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"慶之","kind":"person","person_id":"408_ce3_5d8","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"沈文秀是沈慶之弟之子。"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-shenwenxiu:p001:m0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"劭之","kind":"person","person_id":"jyf_yg2_dqk","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"沈文秀之父。"}],"chapter_id":"c-songshu-088-shenwenxiu","book_id":"b-songshu-088","work_id":"w-songshu","source_id":"s-songshu-088-shenwenxiu-ws2069210"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-song88:p002","text":"景和元年，出為寧朔將軍、冀州刺史，鎮歷城。泰始二年，進號輔國將軍，又進號征虜將軍。時徐州刺史薛安都同逆，上即還道固本號為徐州代之。道固不受命，遣子景微、軍主傅靈越率眾赴安都。既而為土人起義所攻，屢戰失利，閉門自守。會四方平定，上遣使宣慰，道固奉詔歸順。先是與沈文秀共引虜，虜既至，固守距之，因被圍逼。虜每進，輒為道固所摧。三年，以為都督冀青兗幽并五州諸軍事、前將軍、冀州刺史，加節，又進號平北將軍。其年，為虜所陷，被送桑乾，死於虜中。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-songshu-088-song88:p002:m0046","start":46,"end":49,"surface":"薛安都","kind":"person","person_id":"u3k_51j_4ul_A","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"徐州刺史，景微、傅靈越赴援者。"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-song88:p002:m0055","start":55,"end":57,"surface":"道固","kind":"person","person_id":"23q_wcp_hny","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"此時的受命者。"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-song88:p002:m0000","start":65,"end":67,"surface":"道固","kind":"person","person_id":"23q_wcp_hny","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"拒受徐州之命，遣子應薛安都。"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-song88:p002:m0008","start":73,"end":75,"surface":"景微","kind":"person","person_id":"23q_wcp_hny_A","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"崔道固之子。此傳正文作景微。"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-song88:p002:m0078","start":78,"end":81,"surface":"傅靈越","kind":"person","person_id":"kfw_r30_lgz","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"奉道固命與景微率眾赴安都。"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-song88:p002:m0082","start":82,"end":83,"surface":"眾","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"景微、傅靈越所率人眾，個人未具名。"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-song88:p002:m0084","start":84,"end":86,"surface":"安都","kind":"person","person_id":"u3k_51j_4ul_A","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"承本句前文徐州刺史薛安都。"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-song88:p002:m0090","start":90,"end":92,"surface":"土人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"當地起兵者，集體未逐人具名。"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-song88:p002:m0115","start":115,"end":116,"surface":"使","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"明帝所遣使者，名與人數未載。"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-song88:p002:m0119","start":119,"end":121,"surface":"道固","kind":"person","person_id":"23q_wcp_hny","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"奉詔歸順者。"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-song88:p002:m0129","start":129,"end":132,"surface":"沈文秀","kind":"person","person_id":"jyf_yg2_dqk_A","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"同卷有本傳，與崔道固共引北魏軍。"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-song88:p002:m0134","start":134,"end":135,"surface":"虜","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"史書稱北魏方面，未具名將領。"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-song88:p002:m0136","start":136,"end":137,"surface":"虜","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"所引北魏軍。"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-song88:p002:m0143","start":143,"end":144,"surface":"之","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"指已至的北魏軍，非單一人物。"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-song88:p002:m0150","start":150,"end":151,"surface":"虜","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"圍城的北魏軍。"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-song88:p002:m0156","start":156,"end":158,"surface":"道固","kind":"person","person_id":"23q_wcp_hny","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"抵禦圍城魏軍者。"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-song88:p002:m0203","start":203,"end":204,"surface":"虜","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"攻陷城池的北魏軍。"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-song88:p002:m0214","start":214,"end":215,"surface":"虜","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"st